    v\u1EC1 s\xE2n cu\u1ED1i."
  RecoveryPlan: "T\u1EEBng ch\u1EB7ng c\xF3 s\xE2n ch\u1EE9a hai bi v\xE0 \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng
